      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence2-103",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "殘虜畏威，望風奔迸，八載侵地，不戰克復。",
      "reading": "追述失地與克復，八載用本書原數。",
      "note": "追述失地與克復，八載用本書原數。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 103,
      "end_codepoint": 123,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence2-123",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "方當長驅朔漠，窮掃遺醜，況乃自送，無假遠勞。",
      "reading": "說可續向北進。",
      "note": "說可續向北進。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 123,
      "end_codepoint": 145,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence2-145",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "宜使竺靈秀速進滑臺助朱脩之固守，節下大軍進擬河北，則牢、洛遊魂，自然奔退。",
      "reading": "請竺靈秀助朱脩之守滑臺。殿本牢落，數位牢、洛，各有本卷校注。",
      "note": "請竺靈秀助朱脩之守滑臺。殿本牢落，數位牢、洛，各有本卷校注。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 145,
      "end_codepoint": 182,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence2-182",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "且昔人有連年攻戰，失眾乏糧者，猶張膽爭前，莫肯輕退。",
      "reading": "以昔人行兵糧乏而能進為比。",
      "note": "以昔人行兵糧乏而能進為比。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 182,
      "end_codepoint": 208,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence2-208",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "況今青州豐穰，濟漕流通，士馬飽逸，威力無損。",
      "reading": "述青州豐穰、濟漕流通。",
      "note": "述青州豐穰、濟漕流通。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 208,
      "end_codepoint": 230,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence2-230",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "若空棄滑臺，坐喪成業，豈是朝廷受任之旨。」",
      "reading": "以不可輕棄滑臺結束勸諫。",
      "note": "以不可輕棄滑臺結束勸諫。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 230,
      "end_codepoint": 251,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence2-251",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "彥之不納，散敗而歸。",
      "reading": "到彥之未納，軍敗返。",
      "note": "到彥之未納，軍敗返。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 251,
      "end_codepoint": 261,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence2-261",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "太祖聞而善之，以補江夏王義恭征北行參軍、北高平太守。",
      "reading": "文帝稱善，補義恭征北行參軍、北高平太守。",
      "note": "文帝稱善，補義恭征北行參軍、北高平太守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 261,
      "end_codepoint": 287,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence2-287",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "以載禁物繫尚方，久之蒙宥。",
      "reading": "載禁物被繫尚方，後獲赦。",
      "note": "載禁物被繫尚方，後獲赦。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 287,
      "end_codepoint": 300,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence2-300",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "又補衡陽王義季征北長流參軍，遷宣威將軍、鍾離太守。",
      "reading": "補義季征北長流參軍，後遷宣威將軍、鍾離太守。",
      "note": "補義季征北長流參軍，後遷宣威將軍、鍾離太守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 300,
      "end_codepoint": 325,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "隨王玄謨入河，玄謨攻滑臺，護之百舸為前鋒，進據石濟。",
      "reading": "從王玄謨攻滑臺，率百舸據石濟。",
      "note": "從王玄謨攻滑臺，率百舸據石濟。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 26,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence3-26",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "石濟在滑臺西南百二十里。",
      "reading": "記石濟相對滑臺的方位、里數。",
      "note": "記石濟相對滑臺的方位、里數。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 26,
      "end_codepoint": 38,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence3-38",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "及虜救至，又馳書勸玄謨急攻，曰：「昔武皇攻廣固，死沒者亦眾。",
      "reading": "護之再以書勸早攻，引劉裕攻廣固。",
      "note": "護之再以書勸早攻，引劉裕攻廣固。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 38,
      "end_codepoint": 68,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence3-68",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "況事殊曩日，豈得計士眾傷疲，願以屠城為急。」",
      "reading": "護之言情勢有異，宜速取城。",
      "note": "護之言情勢有異，宜速取城。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 68,
      "end_codepoint": 90,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence3-90",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "不從。",
      "reading": "王玄謨未從。",
      "note": "王玄謨未從。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 90,
      "end_codepoint": 93,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence3-93",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "玄謨敗退，不暇報護之。",
      "reading": "王玄謨敗退，未告護之。",
      "note": "王玄謨敗退，未告護之。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 93,
      "end_codepoint": 104,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence3-104",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "護之聞知，而虜悉已牽玄謨水軍大艚，連以鐵鏁三重斷河，欲以絕護之還路。",
      "reading": "北魏軍用王玄謨水軍船斷河，欲絕護之退路。殿本無還。",
      "note": "北魏軍用王玄謨水軍船斷河，欲絕護之退路。殿本無還。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 104,
      "end_codepoint": 138,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence3-138",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "河水迅急，護之中流而下，每至鐵鏁，以長柯斧斷之，虜不能禁。",
      "reading": "護之破阻而下。",
      "note": "護之破阻而下。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 138,
      "end_codepoint": 167,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence3-167",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "唯失一舸，餘舸並全。",
      "reading": "只失一舸。",
      "note": "只失一舸。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 167,
      "end_codepoint": 177,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence3-177",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "留戍靡溝城。",
      "reading": "留戍靡溝城，南史作麋。",
      "note": "留戍靡溝城，南史作麋。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 177,
      "end_codepoint": 183,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "還為江夏王義恭驃騎戶曹參軍，戍淮陰。",
      "reading": "任義恭驃騎戶曹參軍，戍淮陰。",
      "note": "任義恭驃騎戶曹參軍，戍淮陰。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 18,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence4-18",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "加建武將軍，領濟北太守。",
      "reading": "加建武將軍、領濟北太守。",
      "note": "加建武將軍、領濟北太守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 18,
      "end_codepoint": 30,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence4-30",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "率二千人復隨張永攻碻磝，先據委粟津。",
      "reading": "隨張永攻碻磝，先據委粟津。",
      "note": "隨張永攻碻磝，先據委粟津。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 30,
      "end_codepoint": 48,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence4-48",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "虜杜道儁與偽尚書伏連來援碻磝，護之拒之，賊因引軍東去。",
      "reading": "杜道儁與伏連來援，護之拒退。殿本姓壯。",
      "note": "杜道儁與伏連來援，護之拒退。殿本姓壯。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 48,
      "end_codepoint": 75,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence4-75",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "蕭思話遣護之迎軍至梁山，偽尚書韓元興率精騎卒至，護之依險拒戰，斬其都軍長史，甲首數十，賊乃退。",
      "reading": "蕭思話遣迎於梁山，護之迎擊韓元興。",
      "note": "蕭思話遣迎於梁山，護之迎擊韓元興。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 75,
      "end_codepoint": 122,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence4-122",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "思話將引還，誑護之云：「沈慶之救軍垂至，可急於濟口立橋。」",
      "reading": "蕭思話託言沈慶之軍至，以濟口立橋掩還師。",
      "note": "蕭思話託言沈慶之軍至，以濟口立橋掩還師。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 122,
      "end_codepoint": 151,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence4-151",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "護之揣知其意，即分遣白丁。",
      "reading": "護之察其意，遣白丁。",
      "note": "護之察其意，遣白丁。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 151,
      "end_codepoint": 164,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence4-164",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "思話復令度河戍乞活堡以防追軍。",
      "reading": "又令護之戍乞活堡。數位追軍，殿本眾軍。",
      "note": "又令護之戍乞活堡。數位追軍，殿本眾軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 164,
      "end_codepoint": 179,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence4-179",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "三十年春，太祖崩，還屯歷下。",
      "reading": "元嘉三十年春文帝崩，護之屯歷下。",
      "note": "元嘉三十年春文帝崩，護之屯歷下。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 179,
      "end_codepoint": 193,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence4-193",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "聞世祖入討，率所領馳赴，上嘉之，以為督冀州青州之濟南樂安太原三郡諸軍事、寧遠將軍、冀州刺史。",
      "reading": "應孝武入討，為冀州刺史。其督部「青州」殿本無，本紀另有六月壬寅授官。",
      "note": "應孝武入討，為冀州刺史。其督部「青州」殿本無，本紀另有六月壬寅授官。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 193,
      "end_codepoint": 239,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence5-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "孝建元年，南郡王義宣反，兗州刺史徐遺寶，護之妻弟也，遠相連結，與護之書，勸使同逆。",
      "reading": "孝建元年劉義宣反，徐遺寶為護之妻弟，致書邀同反。",
      "note": "孝建元年劉義宣反，徐遺寶為護之妻弟，致書邀同反。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 41,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence5-41",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "護之馳使以聞。",
      "reading": "護之馳報朝廷。",
      "note": "護之馳報朝廷。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 41,
      "end_codepoint": 48,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence5-48",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "遺寶時戍湖陸，護之留子恭祖守歷城，自率步騎襲遺寶。",
      "reading": "留子恭祖守歷城，自攻徐遺寶。",
      "note": "留子恭祖守歷城，自攻徐遺寶。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 48,
      "end_codepoint": 73,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence5-73",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "道經鄒山，破其別戍。",
      "reading": "至鄒山破魏別戍，主語承護之。",
      "note": "至鄒山破魏別戍，主語承護之。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 73,
      "end_codepoint": 83,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence5-83",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "未至湖陸六十里，遺寶焚城西走。",
      "reading": "徐遺寶焚湖陸城西去。",
      "note": "徐遺寶焚湖陸城西去。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 83,
      "end_codepoint": 98,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence6-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "兗土既定，徵為游擊將軍。",
      "reading": "兗土定後徵游擊將軍。",
      "note": "兗土定後徵游擊將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 12,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence6-12",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "隨沈慶之等擊魯爽，加輔國將軍。",
      "reading": "從沈慶之擊魯爽，加輔國。",
      "note": "從沈慶之擊魯爽，加輔國。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 12,
      "end_codepoint": 27,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence6-27",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "義宣率大眾至梁山，與王玄謨相持。",
      "reading": "劉義宣與王玄謨相拒梁山。",
      "note": "劉義宣與王玄謨相拒梁山。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 27,
      "end_codepoint": 43,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence6-43",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "柳元景率護之及護之弟詢之、柳叔仁、鄭琨等諸軍，出鎮新亭。",
      "reading": "柳元景率護之、詢之、柳叔仁、鄭琨屯新亭。",
      "note": "柳元景率護之、詢之、柳叔仁、鄭琨屯新亭。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 43,
      "end_codepoint": 71,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence6-71",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "玄謨見賊強盛，遣司馬管法濟求救甚急。",
      "reading": "玄謨遣司馬管法濟求援。",
      "note": "玄謨遣司馬管法濟求援。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 71,
      "end_codepoint": 89,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence6-89",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "上遣元景等進據南州，護之水軍先發。",
      "reading": "孝武遣元景等據南州，護之水軍先發。",
      "note": "孝武遣元景等據南州，護之水軍先發。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 89,
      "end_codepoint": 106,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence6-106",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "賊遣將龐法起率眾襲姑孰，適值護之、鄭琨等至，奮擊，大破之，斬獲及投水死略盡。",
      "reading": "龐法起襲姑孰，與護之、鄭琨相遇而敗。",
      "note": "龐法起襲姑孰，與護之、鄭琨相遇而敗。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 106,
      "end_codepoint": 144,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence6-144",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "玄謨馳信告元景曰：「西城不守，唯餘東城，眾寡相懸，請退還姑孰，更議進取。」",
      "reading": "王玄謨送信，說西城失守，請退姑孰再議。",
      "note": "王玄謨送信，說西城失守，請退姑孰再議。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 144,
      "end_codepoint": 181,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence6-181",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "元景不許，將悉眾赴救，護之勸分軍援之。",
      "reading": "元景不從玄謨，護之改陳分軍之議。",
      "note": "元景不從玄謨，護之改陳分軍之議。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 181,
      "end_codepoint": 200,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence6-200",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "元景然其計，乃以精兵配護之赴梁山。",
      "reading": "元景採納，遣護之率兵。",
      "note": "元景採納，遣護之率兵。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 200,
      "end_codepoint": 217,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence6-217",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "及戰，護之見賊舟艦累沓，謂玄謨曰：「今當以火平之。」",
      "reading": "舟艦數位累沓，殿本累水。護之主議破敵。",
      "note": "舟艦數位累沓，殿本累水。護之主議破敵。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 217,
      "end_codepoint": 243,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence6-243",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "即使隊主張談等燒賊艦，風猛水急，賊軍以此奔散。",
      "reading": "張談等依令，敵舟敗散。",
      "note": "張談等依令，敵舟敗散。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 243,
      "end_codepoint": 266,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence6-266",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "梁山平，護之率軍追討，會朱脩之已平江陵，至尋陽而還。",
      "reading": "護之追至尋陽，朱脩之已平江陵。",
      "note": "護之追至尋陽，朱脩之已平江陵。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 266,
      "end_codepoint": 292,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence6-292",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "遷督徐兗二州豫州之梁郡諸軍事、寧朔將軍、徐州刺史，封益陽縣侯，食邑千戶。",
      "reading": "遷寧朔將軍、徐州刺史，益陽縣侯，一千戶。",
      "note": "遷寧朔將軍、徐州刺史，益陽縣侯，一千戶。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 292,
      "end_codepoint": 328,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence7-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "二年，護之坐論功挾私，免官。",
      "reading": "孝建二年因論功挾私免官。",
      "note": "孝建二年因論功挾私免官。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 14,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence7-14",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "復為游擊將軍。",
      "reading": "復為游擊。",
      "note": "復為游擊。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 14,
      "end_codepoint": 21,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence7-21",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "俄遷大司馬，輔國將軍，領南東海太守。",
      "reading": "數位本直書俄遷大司馬，注文以為大司馬下脫其僚佐官名，殿本亦只刻大司馬。",
      "note": "數位本直書俄遷大司馬，注文以為大司馬下脫其僚佐官名，殿本亦只刻大司馬。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 21,
      "end_codepoint": 39,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence7-39",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "未拜，復督青冀二州諸軍事、寧遠將軍、青冀二州刺史，鎮歷城。",
      "reading": "領南東海太守尚未拜，改督青、冀及為刺史。",
      "note": "領南東海太守尚未拜，改督青、冀及為刺史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 39,
      "end_codepoint": 68,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence7-68",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "明年，進號寧朔將軍，進督徐州之東莞東安二郡軍事。",
      "reading": "翌年進寧朔、督東莞東安。殿本第二郡署闕。",
      "note": "翌年進寧朔、督東莞東安。殿本第二郡署闕。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 68,
      "end_codepoint": 92,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence7-92",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "世祖以歷下要害，欲移青州并鎮歷城，議者多異。",
      "reading": "孝武議青、冀並鎮歷城。",
      "note": "孝武議青、冀並鎮歷城。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 92,
      "end_codepoint": 114,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence7-114",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "護之曰：「青州北有河、濟，又多陂澤，非虜所向。",
      "reading": "護之答議地形。",
      "note": "護之答議地形。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 114,
      "end_codepoint": 137,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence7-137",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "每來寇掠，必由歷城，二州并鎮，此經遠之略也。",
      "reading": "謂事件歷城受敵，二州宜並鎮。",
      "note": "謂事件歷城受敵，二州宜並鎮。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 137,
      "end_codepoint": 159,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence7-159",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "北又近河，歸順者易，近息民患，遠申王威，安邊之上計也。」",
      "reading": "述北近河而便於來歸。",
      "note": "述北近河而便於來歸。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 159,
      "end_codepoint": 187,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence7-187",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "由是遂定。",
      "reading": "議遂行。",
      "note": "議遂行。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 187,
      "end_codepoint": 192,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence8-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "大明三年，徵為右衞將軍。",
      "reading": "大明三年徵右衞將軍。",
      "note": "大明三年徵右衞將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 12,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence8-12",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "還，於道聞司空竟陵王誕於廣陵反叛，護之即率部曲受車騎大將軍沈慶之節度。",
      "reading": "還途聞竟陵王誕反，率部曲應沈慶之節度。",
      "note": "還途聞竟陵王誕反，率部曲應沈慶之節度。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 12,
      "end_codepoint": 47,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence8-47",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "事平，轉西陽王子尚撫軍司馬、臨淮太守。",
      "reading": "平後為子尚撫軍司馬、臨淮太守。",
      "note": "平後為子尚撫軍司馬、臨淮太守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 47,
      "end_codepoint": 66,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence8-66",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "明年，出為使持節、督豫司二州諸軍事、輔國將軍、豫州刺史、淮南太守。",
      "reading": "大明四年使持節、督豫司、為豫州刺史等。",
      "note": "大明四年使持節、督豫司、為豫州刺史等。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 66,
      "end_codepoint": 99,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence8-99",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "復隸沈慶之伐西陽蠻。",
      "reading": "隸沈慶之出西陽。",
      "note": "隸沈慶之出西陽。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 99,
      "end_codepoint": 109,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence8-109",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "護之所莅多聚斂，賄貨充積。",
      "reading": "傳評多聚斂。",
      "note": "傳評多聚斂。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 109,
      "end_codepoint": 122,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence8-122",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "七年，坐下獄，免官。",
      "reading": "大明七年下獄免官。",
      "note": "大明七年下獄免官。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 122,
      "end_codepoint": 132,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence8-132",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
      "source_quote": "明年，復起為太中大夫，未拜，其年卒，時年七十，諡曰壯侯。",
      "reading": "大明八年起太中大夫，未拜而卒。原報七十，諡壯侯。",
      "note": "大明八年起太中大夫，未拜而卒。原報七十，諡壯侯。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:p008",
      "start_codepoint": 132,
      "end_codepoint": 160,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-yuanhuzhi-complete:received_sentence8-160",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "bdx_txf_e62_AA",
